Error [jet.ComputedFieldAssigned]: `title` is a computed field on `Outer` — it can't be assigned
  --> tests/ui/computed_field_write.jet:27:11
    |
 27 |     outer.title = "b"
    |           ^^^^^
 Why: `title` is declared `title -> …`: its value always comes from that formula, so it has no storage to write, lend for writing or take
 Fix: Change the stored field its formula reads, or call a method of `Outer` that does
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0339

